    "show_share": true,
    "description": "In Dar es Salaam, a reproductive health crisis persists, particularly among adolescents in underserved communities. AKU's School of Nursing and Midwifery, East Africa (SONAM EA) students in Tanzania, as part of their community midwifery course, witnessed these challenges firsthand during home visits. They observed young mothers lacking guidance, male hesitancy in antenatal care, and widespread knowledge gaps.",
